	(text "One root oscillator. No Si5351, and no 74HC4051 in the clock path: that mux is a spur and jitter source on Praline and it does not survive a 12-bit, 20 GSPS converter. OCXO to LMK5C33216 to ADF4382A to LMX1214 to the AD9084 CLK pins. 10 MHz input disciplines the LMK. PPS is a separate SMA, not a mode of the clock SMA."
		(at 20.00 18.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)))
		(uuid "ffd92f86-07fb-5905-b016-a3e506eb1faa")
	)
