	(text "CLKIN accepts 10 MHz, 50 ohm, 0 to +10 dBm, AC coupled, with a 3.3 V TVS after the coupling cap. It disciplines the LMK; it is not muxed onto the converter clock. CLKOUT is 10 MHz from an LMK LVCMOS output through a 33 ohm series resistor. PPS is bidirectional under FPGA control and is the trigger, replacing Praline's P1/P2 analog-mux trigger."
		(at 20.00 190.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "02b5e8ea-90e2-57a4-9a02-38f29560e693")
	)
